{"name":"Disruption with Copilot next edit suggestions","status":"resolved","created_at":"2026-06-17T17:57:49.168Z","updated_at":"2026-06-19T18:50:58.607Z","monitoring_at":"2026-06-17T19:14:46.327Z","resolved_at":"2026-06-17T19:28:16.628Z","impact":"minor","shortlink":"https://stspg.io/7tn8k5v6kzjj","scheduled_for":null,"scheduled_until":null,"scheduled_remind_prior":false,"scheduled_reminded_at":null,"impact_override":"minor","scheduled_auto_in_progress":false,"scheduled_auto_completed":false,"metadata":{},"started_at":"2026-06-17T17:57:49.155Z","reminder_intervals":null,"id":"5t81zk0vrk3z","page_id":"kctbh9vrtdwd","incident_updates":[{"status":"resolved","body":"On June 17, 2026, between 16:57 UTC and 19:14 UTC, Copilot code completions were degraded and users were unable to receive Next Edit Suggestions. Standard ghost text code completions were not affected. This was due to a configuration change that caused the service's routing layer to incorrectly discard all Next Edit Suggestion model endpoints as invalid.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe mitigated the incident by deploying a corrected configuration change at 18:55 UTC, with full recovery observed at 19:14 UTC.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe are working to improve the resilience of our routing layer to limit impact due to a subset of invalid configurations, and to improve our alerting to detect sudden traffic changes that are not captured by standard error rate monitors.","created_at":"2026-06-17T19:28:16.628Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-06-19T18:50:58.601Z","display_at":"2026-06-17T19:28:16.628Z","deliver_notifications":true,"tweet_id":null,"id":"1jjks4czhmn8","incident_id":"5t81zk0vrk3z","custom_tweet":null,"affected_components":null},{"status":"monitoring","body":"The degradation has been mitigated. We are monitoring to ensure stability.","created_at":"2026-06-17T19:14:46.327Z","wants_twitter_update":false,"twitter_updated_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-06-1